.EQN 6 8 78 0
{0:s.a}NAME({0:t}NAME):{0:cos}NAME({0:\n.1}NAME*{0:t}NAME)+2*{0:cos}NAME({0:\n.2}NAME*{0:t}NAME)
.TXT 4 -8 79 0
Cg a65.000000,68.000000,192
{\rtf1\ansi \deff0
{\fonttbl
{\f0\fnil Arial;}
{\f1\fnil Symbol;}
}
{\plain {We can let Mathcad compute the 
exact derivative and then sample it for 
a plotting comparison. Since the FIR gives
 a delay of 1/2 unit, we sample the exact
 derivative with a similar delay.}}
}
.EQN 9 9 81 0
{0:sd.a}NAME({0:t}NAME):-{0:sin}NAME({0:\n.1}NAME*{0:t}NAME)*{0:\n.1}NAME-2*{0:sin}NAME({0:\n.2}NAME*{0:t}NAME)*{0:\n.2}NAME
